### Реєстрація нового користувача
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "chef_olena",
  "email": "olena@example.com",
  "password": "securepass123",
  "name": "Олена Шевченко"
}

### Логін
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "chef_olena",
  "password": "securepass123"
}

### Оновлення токенів
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "d072ff66c4d0ebf7089d6ca9d51dd82f94d1ab9989f6aab722e0c7759048d45b6329e7943fca5e62"
}

### Вихід
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "be513de0d7d01b371c3a4a9254fc01b69bfda22db8d269a8871ab427c3d6949a33635f63001ef62c"
}
